{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31585","headline":"凉公从叔春祭广利王庙 · 李羣玉","name":"凉公从叔春祭广利王庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙骧伐鼓下长川，直济云涛古庙前。\n海客敛威惊火斾，天吴收浪避楼船。\n阴灵向作南溟主，祀典高齐五岳肩。\n从此华夷封域静，潜熏玉烛奉尧年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}